<li><strong>Your certifications</strong> — any training or clearance you\'ve completed</li>
</ul>
<h3>Claiming a Task</h3>
<ol>
<li><strong>Browse available tasks</strong> — filtered to your area and skill level</li>
<li><strong>Click "Claim"</strong> — this reserves a volunteer slot for that task</li>
