<li><strong>Navigate to your assigned task</strong></li>
<li><strong>Click "Clock In"</strong> — this starts tracking your hours</li>
<li><strong>Work the task</strong> — do what the Crew Lead assigned</li>
<li><strong>Click "Clock Out"</strong> when done — this stops the timer</li>
</ol>
<p><strong>If you forget to clock in:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Tell the Crew Lead — they can manually add your hours</li>
<li>Do it the same day — memories fade fast</li>
</ul>
