<h2>Safety Rules for Volunteers</h2>
<p><strong>Volunteers should NEVER:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Work at heights without proper fall protection</li>
<li>Handle hazardous materials (asbestos, lead paint, mold)</li>
<li>Perform licensed work (electrical, plumbing, gas)</li>
<li>Operate heavy machinery</li>
<li>Work alone on-site</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Always:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Follow Crew Lead instructions</li>
<li>Wear provided safety gear</li>
<li>Stay in your assigned area</li>
<li>Ask if you\'re unsure about something</li>
<li>Report any injuries immediately</li>
</ul>
